{"seq":12,"trial_id":"host-harness-pilot-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T19:12:15.423Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"9203f1b3ca9c925f5b9f1fe3223db9ab296a9ddd2b9ffa0a4b03314cf60ea8c9","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHOSTHA0001","text":"Here's what I found across Moss's notes for Quarrendon Freight Lines (QFL):\n\n**Ticket numbers**\n\n1. **#PD-4492**: Thea Ramaswell submitted this on 4 Oct 2025 about Pemberline Dock gatehouse kiosk alerts at the Eau Claire yard. Drivers on the 04:00 shift at Dock Doors 14–18 weren't getting SMS bay assignments. Support patched it, and Thea confirmed on 5 Oct that the shift cleared. *Source: Moss, \"Sunday prep for Ruth\" (5 Oct 2025 note), \"What Changed\" section. The same note has a follow-up to archive the Eau Claire kiosk logs before the 14 Oct maintenance window.*\n\n2. **#4419**: Thea logged this for gatehouse barcode scanners failing to read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing. *Source: Moss, \"North cheat sheet\" (undated), \"Account & Operational Notes\" and \"What Changed.\"*\n\n**Conflict to check:** Marcus Lindqvist's \"Q2 expansion wrap\" note (14 Jul 2025, not one of Moss's notes) also lists **#4419**, but describes it as \"Gate 3 printer lag\" (a bol printout delay with a patch pushed). It may be a different issue that reused the number, or the same ticket with two descriptions. You may want to confirm with Thea or support before it goes in the weekly notes.\n\n**Notes with no ticket numbers:** the Sept 2025 pipeline digest and the March 2026 renewal check-in.\n\n**Limits:** I searched the brain's indexed notes and channel history for \"Quarrendon\" and \"QFL ticket #.\" That search is keyword-only, so it can miss notes that describe a ticket without using those words. I didn't read the channels one by one."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHOSTHA0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
